[
  {
    "content_id": "10054001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我保羅奉我們救主上帝和賜我們盼望的基督耶穌的命令，作基督耶穌的使徒，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;寫信給因信主而作我真兒子的提摩太。 願父上帝和我們的主基督耶穌賜給你恩典、憐憫和平安！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我去馬其頓的時候，曾經勸你繼續留在以弗所，好命令那幾個人不要傳講異端邪說，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;也不要沉迷於無稽之談和冗長的家譜，因為這些事只會引起爭論，無法幫助人憑信心認識上帝的計劃。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;這命令的目的是為了愛，這愛來自於清潔的心、無愧的良心和真實無偽的信心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;可惜有些人卻偏離這些，轉向空洞的談論。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;他們想做律法教師，卻不明白自己所談論所主張的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我們知道，只要用得合宜，律法本是好的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;因為律法並不是為義人設的，而是為了對付那些目無法紀、大逆不道、不敬畏上帝、犯罪作惡、不聖潔、貪戀世俗、殺害父母、行兇害命、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;淫亂、同性戀、拐賣人口、說謊、起假誓的人，以及其他違反正道的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;這正道來自當受稱頌的上帝託付我傳揚的榮耀福音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我感謝賜我力量的主基督耶穌，因為祂視我忠心可靠，派我事奉祂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;儘管我從前是個褻瀆上帝、迫害和侮辱信徒的人，但我仍然蒙了憐憫，因為那時我無知，還沒有信耶穌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我們的主賜給我豐富的恩典，使我在基督耶穌裡有信心和愛心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;這句話千真萬確、完全可信：「基督耶穌降世，為要拯救罪人。」在罪人中我是個罪魁，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;但我依然蒙了憐憫，因為基督耶穌要在我這個罪魁身上彰顯祂無限的忍耐，使我做那些要信靠祂並得永生之人的榜樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;願尊貴、榮耀歸給那位不朽的、肉眼不能見的萬世君王——獨一無二的上帝，直到永遠。阿們！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我兒提摩太啊，我依照從前有關你的預言，把這命令託付給你，好使你藉此打美好的仗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;你要持守信心和無愧的良心。有些人喪掉良心，結果他們的信仰就像船觸了礁，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;其中有許米乃和亞歷山大。我已經把他們交給撒旦，使他們學到教訓，不再說褻瀆的話。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我勸你首先要為所有的人懇求、禱告、代求和感謝上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;也要為所有的君王和掌權者禱告，使我們可以懷著虔誠、端正的心過和平安寧的生活。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;這樣做很美好，是蒙我們的救主上帝悅納的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;因為祂願世人都得救，明白真理。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;上帝只有一位，在上帝和世人之間只有一位中保，就是降世為人的基督耶穌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;祂捨命作所有人的贖價，這在所定的時候已顯明出來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;為此，我被指派做傳道人和使徒，教導外族人認識信仰和真理。我說的是實話，並非謊言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我願男人舉起聖潔的手隨處禱告，不發怒，不爭辯。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我願女人衣著得體，樸素端莊，不靠髮型、珠寶金飾或名貴衣服來妝飾自己，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;要有善行，這樣才配稱為敬畏上帝的女人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;女人應當安安靜靜地學習，完全順服。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我不准女人教導或管轄男人，她們應當保持安靜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;因為先造的是亞當，後造的是夏娃，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;並非亞當受騙，而是夏娃受騙陷入罪中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;不過，女人如果持守信心和愛心，聖潔自律，就必在生育的事上得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;「人若渴望做教會的監督，就是在愛慕尊貴的工作。」這句話千真萬確。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;作監督的人必須無可指責，只有一位妻子，為人節制自律、受人尊敬、樂於接待客旅、善於教導、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;待人溫和，不酗酒、不好鬥、不爭吵、不貪財，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;善於管理自己的家，受兒女的敬重和孝順。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;一個人要是不懂得管理自己的家，又怎能照顧上帝的教會呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;初信主的人不可作監督，免得他自高自大，遭受魔鬼所受的懲罰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;作監督的在教會以外也必須有好名聲，以免被人指責，陷入魔鬼的圈套。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;同樣，做執事的也要品行端正，說話誠實，不好酒，不貪財，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;要存著清潔的良心持守奧妙的真道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;他們要先接受考驗，倘若無可指責，就可以立他們為執事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;執事的妻子也要品行端正，不搬弄是非，為人節制，做事忠心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;執事只能有一位妻子，他要管好自己的兒女和自己的家。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;盡忠職守的執事能得到好聲譽，也會對基督耶穌有堅定的信心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我希望能儘快去你那裡，但還是先寫信告訴你這些事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;這樣，如果我行期延誤，你也可以知道在上帝的家中該怎麼做。這家是永活上帝的教會，是真理的柱石和根基。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;毫無疑問，我們偉大的信仰奧妙無比： 祂以肉身顯現， 被聖靈證明為義， 被天使看見， 被傳揚到列邦， 被世人信奉， 被接到天上的榮耀中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;聖靈明確地說，日後必有人離棄真道，去追隨那些迷惑人的邪靈和鬼魔的學說。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;這些學說是出自假冒偽善的騙子，他們良心喪盡，麻木不仁，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;禁止人結婚和吃某些食物。其實那些食物是上帝創造的，為了讓相信並且明白真理的人存感恩的心領受。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;上帝所造的一切都是美好的，若以感恩的心去領受，就無需任何禁忌，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;因為上帝的道和人的禱告可以使食物聖潔。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你若提醒弟兄姊妹這些事，就是基督耶穌的好僕人，在信仰之道和你所遵行的美善教導上得到了造就。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;但你要棄絕世俗、荒誕的傳說，要訓練自己做敬虔的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;鍛煉身體益處還少，敬虔生活萬事受益，擁有今生和永世的應許。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;這話真實可信，值得完全接受。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我們勞苦奮鬥正是為此，因為我們的盼望在於永活的上帝。祂是天下人的救主，更是信徒的救主。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;你要吩咐和教導這些事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;不要因為年輕而叫人小看你，總要在言語、行為、愛心、信心和純潔各方面做信徒的榜樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;在我來之前，你要專心宣讀聖經，勉勵會眾，教導真理。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;不要忽略你的恩賜，那是藉著預言在眾長老把手按在你身上時賜給你的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你要全心全意做這些事，讓大家都看到你的長進。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你要注意自己的言行和教導，並持之以恆。這樣，你不但能救自己，也能救那些聽你教導的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;不要斥責年長的，要像對待父親一樣勸他們；對待青年男子要情同手足；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;對待年長的婦女要情同母親；對待青年女子要心思純正，視她們如姊妹。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;要敬重和幫助那些真正有需要的寡婦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;寡婦如果有兒孫，就要叫她們的兒孫在家中學習盡孝道，奉養她們，以報答養育之恩，這是上帝所悅納的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;真正有需要、無依無靠的寡婦仰賴上帝的幫助，晝夜不住地禱告祈求。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;但貪圖享樂的寡婦雖然活著，卻已經死了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你當教導眾人這些事，好叫他們無可指責。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;誰不照顧自己的親屬，尤其是不照顧自己的家人，就是背棄信仰，比不信的人還壞。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;列入名冊的寡婦必須年滿六十歲，在婚姻上從一而終，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;並且在善事上有好名聲，如教養兒女、接待外人、服侍聖徒、救助困苦、竭力做各種善事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;不要把年輕的寡婦列入名冊，因為當她們情慾衝動、無法持守對基督的委身時，就想再嫁，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;以致違背了起初的誓言而受審判。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;況且，她們不僅懶散成性，四處串門，還說長道短，好管閒事，搬弄是非。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;所以，我建議年輕的寡婦再嫁，生兒育女，料理家務，不要給仇敵毀謗的機會，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;因為有些人已經偏離正道，去追隨撒旦了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;女信徒的家裡若有寡婦，就應該自己照顧她們，免得加重教會的負擔，這樣教會才能照顧那些真正無依無靠的寡婦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;那些善於管理教會的長老，尤其是那些辛勤傳道和教導人的，理當得到加倍的敬養。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;因為聖經上說：「牛在踩穀時，不可籠住牠的嘴。」又說：「工人理應得到工錢。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;若有人向你控告長老，必須有兩三個證人，否則不要受理。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;那些一直犯罪的人，你要當眾責備他們，以警戒眾人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我在上帝和基督耶穌及蒙揀選的眾天使面前吩咐你：要遵行這些話，不要有成見，不要偏心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;為人行按手禮，不要操之過急。不要沾染別人的罪，要潔身自好。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;你的胃不好，經常生病，不要只喝水，要稍微喝一點酒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;有些人的罪很明顯，自招審判，有些人的罪日後才暴露出來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 5:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;同樣，有些善行很明顯，不明顯的也不會被長久埋沒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;作奴僕的要全心尊重自己的主人，免得上帝的名和我們的教導被人褻瀆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;如果主人是基督徒，作奴僕的不可因為同是信徒就不尊敬自己的主人，反而要更好地服侍他，因為這些接受服侍的人是蒙愛的信徒。你要教導和強調這些事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;如果有人傳其他教義，不符合我們主耶穌基督純正的道和敬虔的教導，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他就是狂妄自大、一無所知。這種人專好問難，爭辯字句，結果引起嫉妒、紛爭、毀謗和猜忌，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;使那些思想敗壞、失去真理的人爭論不休，把敬虔當作生財之道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;其實敬虔和知足才是真財富，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因為我們空手來到世上，也要空手離開。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;只要有吃有穿，就該知足。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;那些渴望發財的人卻陷入誘惑、網羅和許多愚蠢有害的慾望中，以致陷入敗壞和滅亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;貪財是萬惡之根，有人因為貪財就離棄了信仰，結果飽嘗各種錐心之痛。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;但你這屬上帝的人要遠避這些事，要追求公義、敬虔、信心、愛心、忍耐和溫柔，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;要為真道打美好的仗，並持定永生。你是為永生蒙召的，並在許多見證人面前做過美好的見證。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;在賜萬物生命的上帝面前，也在向本丟·彼拉多做過美好見證的基督耶穌面前，我囑咐你：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;要遵守這命令，做純潔無瑕、無可指責的人，一直到我們的主耶穌基督再來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;到了時候，配得稱頌、獨有權能的萬王之王、萬主之主要使基督顯現。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;上帝是獨一不朽的，住在人不能接近的光中，從來沒有人見過祂，也沒有人能夠看見祂。願尊貴和永遠的權柄都歸給祂。阿們！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你要勸誡那些今世富足的人不要高傲，也不要冀望於靠不住的錢財，要信靠將萬物厚賜給我們享用的上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;你要勸他們行善，廣積善行，慷慨施捨，樂意助人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;他們這樣做是為自己積攢財寶，為將來奠定美好的根基，好持守真正的生命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;提摩太啊，你要持守所託付給你的，避開世俗的空談和那些違背真理、似是而非的學問。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前書 6:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;有些自稱有這種學問的人已經偏離了信仰。 願恩典與你們同在！</p>"
  }
]